LOCachy: libinput's circular scrolling fixes and Panasonic round touchpads,
not yet in a release, over libinput 1.32.0 (patch(1) skips this text):
- 4cf1775d "quirks: system-panasonic: add CF-SV8 touchpad", merged into main
  on 2026-10-17 (!1521);
- !1514 "Implement support for Let's Note CF-FV, fixes for CF-SV1" at its head
  3f0ccc4a (open): a ring touch held by tap to click keeps its zone (before,
  circular scrolling never started with tapping on), a stop event when the
  finger lifts, a single-finger gesture only, the ring measured from the
  reachable edge, the CF-FV1 quirk and tests.
Drop it when Arch's libinput has them.

